  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Counter-trafficking Efforts in the Philippines to Combat Forced Criminality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the Government of the Philippines&apos; counter-trafficking efforts, particularly for migrants victim of trafficking for forced criminality (VoT for FC). The initiative will ensure that VoTs have access to adequate protection services in line with the country&#x2019;s international laws and obligations.</narrative>
  </description>
